+
+// AppSwap session recording (Milestone 1): the renderer-side half of the
+// app_swap.mojom.PaintOpRecordingObserver[Client] pipe pair -- see that
+// mojom file's own design note for the full architecture and precedent
+// this is modeled on (cc.mojom.RenderFrameMetadataObserver).
+//
+// Deliberately NOT a cc::RenderFrameMetadataObserver-style interface
+// formally registered with cc::LayerTreeHost: this needs the real
+// cc::Layer tree (cc::CommitState::root_layer) directly, not a
+// post-processed metadata struct, so it's driven by a plain callback
+// LayerTreeView invokes from its own WillCommit() override -- see
+// LayerTreeView::SetPaintOpRecordingCallback() and WidgetBase::
+// InitializeCompositing() (where this class is constructed and wired up,
+// mirroring WidgetBase::CreateRenderFrameObserver()'s own mojo-pipe
+// bootstrap shape).
+//
+// Uses Layer::CapturePaintOpDisplayListForTesting() (cc/layers/layer.h)
+// rather than the zero-forced-repaint production PictureLayer::
